  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1501.09 Amendments to Form A. The applicant shall promptly advise the commissioner of any changes in the information furnished on Form A arising subsequent to the date upon which the information was furnished but prior to the commissioner's disposition of the application.\n\nSource. #1900, eff 1-1-82; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5652, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6985, eff 5-1-99, EXPIRED: 5-1-07\n\nNew. #8910, eff 7-1-07; ss by #10450, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13692, eff 7-21-23",
